<title>USA: Crowley, Milner &amp; Co Q1 shr loss widens.</title>
<headline>Crowley, Milner &amp; Co Q1 shr loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>May 3	    May 4	     May 4 1996</p>
<p>			   1997	     1996	 (As Restated)**</p>
<p>    Net Sales  $ 44,096,169*  $ 23,266,615*	$ 23,266,615*</p>
<p>Net Income (Loss)</p>
<p>		   $ (4,003,871)  $ (1,311,566)	$ (1,369,110)</p>
