<p>			 1,510,578	  956,069		956,069</p>
<p>NOTES: *The Steinbach Store sales were not reported on a consolidated basis during the first quarter ended May 4, 1996. Q1 1996 was aided by $4 million of adjustments related to the Steinbach acquisition.</p>
<p>** Restated as a result of the Company's change in reporting its inventories from the last-in, first out (LIFO) to the first-in, first out (FIFO) method of accounting.</p>
